Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.42,1:00:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.34,1:00:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(理查·布鲁克)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.62,1:00:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(获奖演员参演热门医疗剧)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.65,1:01:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(理查·布鲁克  简历)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.75,1:06:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(过来玩吧  巴茨医院楼顶  —夏·福)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.41,1:06:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(我有你也许想拿回去的东西)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.15,1:08:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(我在等着你哦  金·莫)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.66,1:11:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(好戏开始了哦)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.54,1:23:52.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(冒牌天才自杀)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.95,1:25:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么今天来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想听我说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to hear me say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距你上次约诊已经过了一年半\N{\fnArial\fs30}18 months since our last appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看报吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read the papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也看电视吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you watch telly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我为什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来是因为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherl...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My best friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱辛巴赫瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falls Of The Reichenbach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特纳（英国画家）的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner's masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸得寻回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankfully recovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了绝世奇才夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}owing to the prodigious talent of Mr Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这份小礼物代表了我们的谢意\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small token of our gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钻石袖扣  我的衬衫袖口都有扣子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamond cufflinks... All my cuffs have buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:01:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我说了吗  - 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I?  -  Just say it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you.  -  Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于能和家人团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back together with my family, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在恐怖的劫难过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after my terrifying ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要感谢这位帮我逃过一劫的人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have one person to thank for my deliverance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领带夹  我从不戴领带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie pin. I don't wear ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼得·瑞科莱蒂  自1982年起就占据了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Ricoletti... Number one on Interpol's 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.69,0:02:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警通缉名单榜首\N{\fnArial\fs30}most wanted list since 1982.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:37.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们抓住了他  我们必须感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, We got him, and there's one person 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位为我们提供了决定性线索的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to thank for giving us the decisive leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了他惯用的那些手腕和才智\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all his customary diplomacy and tact.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 反话  - 可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarcasm.  -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都出钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all chipped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把帽子戴上  把帽子戴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the hat on. Put the hat on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:57.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  夏洛克  戴上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sherlock, put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就应付一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Boffin!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术专家夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Boffin Sherlock Holmes!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每人都得有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody gets one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一个什么  - 小报绰号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One what?  -  Tabloid nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:21.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏珊大妈  阴险尼克(真人秀名人)\N{\fnArial\fs30}SuBo, Nasty Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许很快我也会有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll probably get one soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第五页  第六栏  第一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page five, column six, first sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么非要登戴帽子的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it always the hat photograph?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 单身汉约翰·华生  - 这算什么帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Bachelor John Watson."  -  What kind of hat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单身汉  他们到底在暗示什么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bachelor" What the hell are they implying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算帽子吗  为什么两边都有檐  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a cap? Why has it got two fronts?  
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是猎鹿帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a deerstalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常与他如影随形的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Frequently seen in the company of 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 单身汉约翰·华生  - 用这帽子猎鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- bachelor John Watson".  -  Stalk deer with the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么用  扔着玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}" What are you going to do, throw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已证实约翰·华生是单身汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Confirmed bachelor John Watson."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 猎杀飞盘  - 这太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A death frisbee!  -  This is too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们得小心点了  - 上面还有垂檐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we need to be more careful.  -  It's got flaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:46.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遮耳垂檐  这是遮耳帽  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ear flaps, it's an ear hat, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说小心点是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, more careful?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  这已经不是猎鹿帽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this isn't a deerstalker now, 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是夏洛克·福尔摩斯的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a Sherlock Holmes hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说  你不再是个私家侦探了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're not exactly a private detective any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你就快成名人了  - 会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're this far from famous.  -  It'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好能过去  媒体风向会变  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It better pass. The press will turn, Sherlock,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们总变来变去  他们会转过来针对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they always turn and they'll turn on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真的这么在意  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It really bothers you.  -  What? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 人们的看法  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What people say.  -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是对我的看法  我不懂你为什么会心烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}About me? I don't understand. Why would it upset you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尽量保持低调就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try to keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这周找点小案子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find yourself a little case this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再上新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你电话响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直响个没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  你跟他长谈过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did you just talk to him for a really long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利·费什加没有自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Fishguard never committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些伦敦警探什么都看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bow Street runners missed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这案子挺急的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressing case, is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没解决的案子都急\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all pressing until they're solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请收好您的钥匙  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your key back please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有金属物品吗  钥匙  手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any metal objects, keys, mobile phones?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以通过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要来杯茶吗  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a cuppa then, mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国债收益为七\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilts at seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荷兰电信暴跌  谢谢  哈维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dutch Telecoms in free-fall. Thank you, Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说这样好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拒绝所有假释申请  并恢复死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refuse them all parole and bring back the rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急情况  请离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an emergency. Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  我必须请您离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'm going to have to ask you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官  有非法闯入案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there's been a break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在我们的职责范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not our division.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定不想放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金库\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然黑了伦敦塔安保系统  怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hacked into the Tower of bloody London's security?! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就说我们马上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them we're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:39.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有一起  还是非法闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been another one, another break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英格兰银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bank of England!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官  安保系统坏了  失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir! Security's down, sir. It's failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本顿维尔监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pentonville Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:22.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}No rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.45,0:09:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it, shall I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给你  - 现在没空  忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here.  -  Not now, I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克  - 没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock...  -  Not now! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玻璃比什么都坚硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That glass is tougher than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但比不上碳晶体  他用的是钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tougher than crystallised carbon. He used a diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备好了  - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready?  -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生  - 退后  退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Holmes. Mr Holmes.  -  Stand back. Stand back. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让他们过去  - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let them through.  -  Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:50.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记住...  - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember...  -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记住...  - 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember...  -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住他们告诉你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what they told you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别耍小聪明  - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't try to be clever.  -  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你  简单明了好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just keep it simple and brief. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道上庭的明星证人就不能才智超群吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid the star witness at the trial should come across intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才智可以  你那天才欠揍性格就免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligent, fine. Let's give "Smart-arse" a wide berth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我该怎样还怎样  - 你有没有听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll just be myself.  -  Are you listening to me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在今天  在中央刑事法庭外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, outside the Old Bailey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:11:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这场审判是世纪...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the trial of the century...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对金姆斯·莫里亚蒂的审判...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trial of James Moriarty...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金姆斯·莫里亚蒂今天早些时候被指控...\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Moriarty, earlier today accused of...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企图盗窃王冠权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}attempting to steal the Crown Jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在中央刑事法庭我们将见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the Old Bailey we have 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱辛巴赫英雄夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reichenbach hero Sherlock Holmes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你介意把手伸到我的口袋里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind slipping your hand into my pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂王冠偷窃案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crown Moriarty, 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请前往第10法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}please proceed to Court 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:55.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进错厕所了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong toilet. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是你的超级粉丝  - 显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a big fan.  -  Evidently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我读了你那些案子  一直在追\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read your cases, follow them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我衬衫上签个名好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign my shirt, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的粉丝分两种\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two types of fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有本事在我再杀人前抓住我  这是第一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch me before I kill again, Type A.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 第二种呢  - 搭个出租就到我家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's Type B?  -  Your bedroom's just a taxi ride away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜我是哪种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess which one I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都不是  - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neither.  -  Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不是粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not a fan at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你前臂上的压痕  是在桌子边缘压的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those marks on your forearm, edge of a desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是匆忙打字造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been typing in a hurry, probably, 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:30.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,截稿时间到了  压力巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}pressure on, facing a deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的手腕上有墨迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a smudge of ink on your wrist,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上衣口袋鼓起\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bulge in your left jacket pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这就露馅了  - 那污点是故意弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bit of a giveaway?  -  The smudge is deliberate,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想看看我是不是像别人说的那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see if I'm as good as they say I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,油墨  报纸印刷用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oil-based, used in newspaper print.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是用食指涂抹的  你的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}But drawn on with an index finger, your finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为记者  你不太可能在报社沾到油墨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Journalist. Unlikely you get your hands dirty at the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你抹在那里是试探我  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You put that there to test me.  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开始喜欢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm liking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能拿我写篇好专题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may like a great feature,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《夏洛克·福尔摩斯  帽檐下的真相》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sherlock Holmes, the man beneath the hat".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:13:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姬蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitty...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱利  很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riley. Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我还是帮你免了这一问吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm just saving you the trouble of asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不接受采访  \N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I won't give you an interview. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我也不需要钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't want the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和约翰·华生只是精神伴侣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and John Watson, just platonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能否在这个问题上也记下个不字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I put you down for a "No" there as well
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新闻界有你们各种各样的绯闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's all sorts of gossip in the press about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迟早你会需要个和你同一战线的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, you're going to need someone on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个帮你澄清流言的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone to set the record straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你能完成这种工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the girl for that job, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:31.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很聪明  你可以信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm smart and you can trust me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聪明  好吧  调查型记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart? OK, investigative journalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  看着我说出你看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Well, look at me and tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能力出众  你根本不需要采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're that skilful, you don't need an interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以直接读到你要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can just read what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做不到吗  还是我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? OK, my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你仍在寻找职业生涯第一份独家新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look at you and I see someone who's still waiting for their first big scoop,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:57.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以得到编辑的关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}so their editor will notice them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:14:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿了条昂贵的短裙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wearing an expensive skirt, 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还改过两次裙边  \N{\fnArial\fs30}that's been rehemmed twice. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你仅有的高档裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only posh skirt you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的指甲  你没钱经常保养\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your nails, you can't afford to do them that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了一个欲望强烈的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see someone who's hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:08.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到的不是聪明  当然更不是可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see smart. I definitely don't see trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你句引语吧  五个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a quote. If you like. Three little words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.15,0:15:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You repel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 犯罪顾问  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "A consulting criminal."  -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能详细解释一下证词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words. Can you expand on that answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金姆斯·莫里亚蒂受人雇佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Moriarty is for hire. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是个商人  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A tradesman?  -  Yes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是帮你修暖气的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not the sort who'd fix your heating?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是帮你装炸弹或策划暗杀那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the sort who'd plant a bomb or stage an assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我猜让他修锅炉也能干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sure he'd make a decent job of your boiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否会将他描述为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you describe him as...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 引导  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leading.  -  What? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.71,0:15:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不行  你这是引导证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do that.  You're leading the witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会反对  而法官会支持  \N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll object and the judge'll uphold.  
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:55.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问我怎么看  问我如何描述他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me how, how would I describe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:16:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对他有怎样的看法  他们没教过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What opinion have I formed of him? They don't teach you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生  没有你帮忙法庭照样转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, we are fine without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你如何描述这个人  他的性格如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you describe this man, his character?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错误一\N{\fnArial\fs30}First mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金姆斯·莫里亚蒂根本不是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Moriarty isn't a man at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是只蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:16.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,网中心的蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spider at the centre of a web,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这张犯罪网中有上千条线\N{\fnArial\fs30}a criminal web with a thousand threads
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他对每一条的运作都了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he knows precisely how each and every single one of them dances.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你们认识...  - 不  别问这问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how long...? - No, no. Don't, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这问题烂透了  - 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's really not a good question. - Mr Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识他多久了  问得真不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I known him? Not your best line of enquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见过两次  总共五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met twice, five minutes in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿枪指着他  他想炸死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled a gun, he tried to blow me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我俩好像挺来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt we had a special something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索雷尔律师  你真觉得这人是个专家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Sorrel, are you seriously claiming this man is an expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和被告就见过五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}After knowing the accused for just five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟我就能看透一个人  五分钟够充裕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes would have made me an expert, five was ample.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生  那由陪审团决定  - 是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Holmes, that's a matter for the jury. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个图书管理员  两个老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}One librarian, two teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两人工作压力很大  应该是金融人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}two high-pressure jobs, probably the City.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪审团主席是医疗秘书  外国受训\N{\fnArial\fs30}The foreman's a medical secretary, trained abroad, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 因为她的速记  - 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- judging by her shorthand. - Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.53,0:17:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七个已婚  两个在和对方搞外遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven are married, two are having an affair with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们刚用完下午茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've just had tea and biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道谁吃了威化饼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know who ate the wafer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传唤你来是为了回答索雷尔律师的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been called here to answer Miss Sorrel's questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是让你来展示自己有多聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to give us a display of your intellectual prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请言简意赅地回答问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your answers brief and to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则就算你蔑视法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else will be treated as contempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少显摆一会儿你能死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you could survive for just a few minutes with out showing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说什么来着  让你别耍小聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say? I said don't get clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是水龙头说关就关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just turn it on and off like a tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如何  - 什么如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - Well, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.73,0:18:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是一直在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there for the whole thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从头到尾都在旁听\N{\fnArial\fs30}up in the gallery, start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said it would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他靠着椅背  一直很淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}sat on his backside, never even stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂根本不打算为自己辩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty is not mounting any defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英格兰银行  伦敦塔  本顿维尔监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bank of England, Tower of London, Pentonville.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全国最安全的三个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of the most secure places in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六周以前  莫里亚蒂成功闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}and six weeks ago, Moriarty breaks in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道手法  或者原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}no-one knows how or why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们只知道...  - 他被拘留了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All we know is... - He ended up in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别这样  - 哪样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do that. - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那表情  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The look. - Look? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又露出那表情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing the look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己又看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't see it, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的脸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  而且你露出了一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes and it's doing a thing, you are doing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我们都知道到底怎么回事"的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We both know what's really going on here" face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 确实嘛  - 我就不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We do. - No, I don't, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才讨厌你那表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I find the face so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果莫里亚蒂想要王冠  他早就拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Moriarty wanted the jewels, he'd have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想放走犯人  他们也会出狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wanted the prisoners freed, they'd be out on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他之所以现在还在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason he's still in a prison cell right now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为他想要被关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because he chose to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他计划的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow this is part of his scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克雷西尔律师  请传第一位证人上法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Crayhill, can we have your first witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.81,0:19:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法官大人  我们没有证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Honour, we're not calling any witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是辩无罪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've entered a plea of not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我的当事人并未提供任何证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless, my client is offering no evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被告陈述完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The defence... rests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪审团的各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen of the jury,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金姆斯·莫里亚蒂被控告\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Moriarty stands accused...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和多起盗窃未遂案有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}of several counts of attempted burglary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若他罪名成立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crimes which, if he's found guilty,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将被监禁多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}will elicit a very long custodial sentence,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  他的法律团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet... his legal team...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:48.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却不提供任何证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}has chosen to offer no evidence 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来为他进行辩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatsoever to support their plea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这虽不同寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find myself in the unusual position
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.66,0:19:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我由衷建议陪审团做出这样的裁决\N{\fnArial\fs30}of recommending a verdict wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:59.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们必须判他有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must find him guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们必须判他有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must find him guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪审团回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming back. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才六分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话居然用了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprised it took them that long, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厕所排队的人真多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a queue for the loo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请陪审团宣布你们一致通过的裁决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you reached a verdict on which you all agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罪名不成立  他们居然判他无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not guilty, they found him not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有辩护  莫里亚蒂无罪释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}No defence and Moriarty's walked free.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在听吗  他出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you listening? He's out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他会找上你  夏...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know he'll be coming after you. Sherl...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般人会先敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我想你也不是一般人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, you're not most people, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水正好开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kettle's just boiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:22:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴赫都会震惊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johann Sebastian would be appalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能坐吗  - 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I? - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.13,0:22:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗  巴赫临死之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know when he was on his deathbed, Bach,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.17,0:22:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听见自己儿子在用钢琴弹奏他的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}he heard his son at the piano playing one of his... pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没弹完  男孩就不弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy stopped before he got to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个弥留之人就跳下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dying man jumped out of bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.93,0:22:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑到钢琴边弹完了整首曲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}ran to the piano and finished it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法忍受未完成的乐章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't cope with an unfinished melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是  所以你才过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither can you, that's why you've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话吧  你也挺开心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be honest, you're a tiny bit pleased. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  审判结果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, with the verdict?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.42,0:22:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又回来兴风作浪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me, back on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.22,0:22:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个童话故事都要有个老派的坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every fairy tale needs a good old-fashioned villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要我  否则你屁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me or you're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们本来就很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're just alike, you and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是你比我无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}except you're boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你站在正义那一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on the side of the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.07,0:22:55.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用说  你控制了陪审团\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to the jury, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:22:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都能闯入伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got into the Tower of London,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.41,0:23:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,12间酒店房间又算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think I can't worm my way into 12 hotel rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有线网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cable network.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.27,0:23:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个房间都有私人电视屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hotel bedroom has a personalised TV screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有自己的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every person has their pressure point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都有自己想保护的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone that they want to protect from harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.93,0:23:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小菜一碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how are you going to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么毁了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重点就在这儿  最后的难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem, the final problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想到是什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you worked out what it is yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.40,0:23:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后的难题到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the final problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你  不过你仔细听了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did tell you... but did you listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你来说  说句"我不知道"有多困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}How hard do you find it, having to say "I don't know"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道  - 很聪明啊  真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - That's clever, very clever, awfully clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起聪明  你跟你那些小朋友说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of clever, have you told your little friends yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.37,0:24:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told them what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为何我闯入那些地方却空手而回  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why I broke into all those places and never took anything? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.54,0:24:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但你明白  - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you understand? - Obviously. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.37,0:24:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那请说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off you go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.19,0:24:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己也知道  我还说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to tell you what you already know? 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我要你证明你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I want you to prove that you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么都不拿是因为你不需要  - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't take anything because you don't need to. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.17,0:24:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再也不用拿任何东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never need to take anything ever again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, because?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为英格兰银行  伦敦塔和本顿维尔监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because nothing in the Bank of England, the Tower of London 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.81,0:24:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面没有东西能比上你手里那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Pentonville Prison could possibly match the value of 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.22,0:24:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你闯入其中的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the key that could get you into all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.77,0:24:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何地方的任何门我都打得开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can open any door anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要几行计算机代码就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a few tiny lines of computer code.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.76,0:24:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么私人银行账户都是胡扯  全属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No such thing as a private bank account now, they're all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有秘密了  我掌控着秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}No such thing as secrecy, I own secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.28,0:24:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核武器编码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear codes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.44,0:24:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我随随便便就能炸了北约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could blow up NATO in alphabetical order.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.96,0:24:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满世界都是封锁的房间  有钥匙便是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a world of locked rooms, the man with the key is king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.31,0:24:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  你真该看看我戴王冠的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And honey, you should see me in a crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是利用审讯宣传自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were advertising all through the trial,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.53,0:24:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给世人展现你的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were showing the world what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.68,0:24:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也帮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.62,0:25:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客户可多了  自由政府  情报组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big client list... rogue governments, intelligence communities,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.58,0:25:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrorist cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.76,0:25:07.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都想要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.22,0:25:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转眼我就成了万人迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly, I'm Mr Sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.37,0:25:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能进入任何银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can break any bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.14,0:25:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在乎什么最高价竞买人\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you care about the highest bidder?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎  我就爱看他们抢破头的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't, I just like to watch them all competing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"爸爸最爱的是我"  凡人真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Daddy loves me the best." Aren't ordinary people adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这你知道  你有约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, you've got John.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.11,0:25:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也该找个同居男友才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should get myself a live-in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.56,0:25:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要这么做  - 肯定很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you doing all of this? - It must be so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并不真的想要金钱或权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want money or power, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.15,0:25:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it all for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.96,0:25:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想解决那个难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to solve the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.84,0:25:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后的难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要开始了  夏洛克  坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to start very soon, Sherlock... the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.95,0:25:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过别怕  坠落跟飞翔一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't be scared, falling is just like flying,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.17,0:25:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过下场只有死亡而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}except there's a more permanent destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.45,0:26:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never liked riddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.44,0:26:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学着喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.36,0:26:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我欠你一次坠落  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I owe you a fall, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  欠  你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... owe... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.23,0:27:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰下  我找麦考夫·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, I'm looking for Mycroft Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.32,0:27:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问他在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you happen to know if he's around at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.08,0:28:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听不见我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.05,0:28:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  有人知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, all right. Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.24,0:28:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone at all know...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.42,0:28:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考夫·福尔摩斯在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Mycroft Holmes is, 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.69,0:28:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人叫我来这儿见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been asked to meet him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.50,0:28:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人理我  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No takers, right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.71,0:28:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是透明的吗  你们看得见我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I invisible, can you actually see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.04,0:28:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢两位  有人叫我来找麦考夫·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, gents. I've been asked to meet Mycroft Holmes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.30,0:28:18.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传统嘛  约翰  传统界定了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tradition, John, our traditions define us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.90,0:28:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准讲话算哪门子传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}So total silence is traditional, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.06,0:28:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连句"把糖递给我"都不能说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't even say pass the sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.90,0:28:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大半个外交部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-quarters of the diplomatic service
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和半个政府议会要员在一起喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and half the government front bench all sharing one tea trolley,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.92,0:28:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为大家好  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's for the best, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可不想重演1972年的事(血色星期天事件)\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want a repeat of... 1972.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.40,0:28:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不过在这儿可以说话  - 你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we can talk in here. - You read this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.18,0:28:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.19,0:28:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周六他们要爆个猛料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saturday, they're doing a big expose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.89,0:28:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好奇她从哪得到的这些信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to know where she got her information.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个叫布鲁克的人  认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone called Brook. Recognise the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.27,0:28:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是校友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}School friend, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克的校友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of Sherlock's?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.51,0:29:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这不是我叫你来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not why I asked you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.44,0:29:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是谁  - 不认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - Don't know? 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.22,0:29:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不认识  - 没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Never seen his face before?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚搬到贝克街  就和你隔了两户人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taken a flat in Baker Street, two doors down from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.10,0:29:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正想拜访下邻居呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking of doing a drinks thing for the neighbours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.58,0:29:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看还是算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure you'll want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.11,0:29:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏莱曼尼  阿尔巴尼亚职业杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulejmani, Albanian hit squad, expertly trained killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.40,0:29:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就住在离你家不到20英尺的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}living less than 20 feet from your front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.97,0:29:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那地段很好  坐地铁很方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a great location. Jubilee line's handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.67,0:29:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  - 这跟我有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John... - What's it got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.03,0:29:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德琴科·卢德米拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dyachenko Ludmila.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.73,0:29:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我好像见过她  - 俄国杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, I think I have seen her. - Russian killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.17,0:29:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住你家对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's taken the flat opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.54,0:29:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.58,0:29:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点明白你的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sensing a pattern here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.01,0:29:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  四个国际顶级刺客都搬到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, four top international assassins relocate
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,221B附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}to within spitting distance of 221b.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.01,0:29:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么想告诉我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you'd care to share with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该搬家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm moving? 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.44,0:29:59.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不难猜到他们的共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not hard to guess the common denominator, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.74,0:30:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得是莫里亚蒂安排的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is Moriarty?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.03,0:30:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟夏洛克说他一定会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised Sherlock he'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.77,0:30:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这是莫里亚蒂的杰作  我们早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this was Moriarty, we'd be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.58,0:30:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是莫里亚蒂  那又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not Moriarty, then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你既然这么担心他  怎么不去找夏洛克谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you talk to Sherlock, if you're so concerned about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.71,0:30:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.75,0:30:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们之间有太多事  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much history between us, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.76,0:30:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旧账  愤恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old scores, resentments.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.47,0:30:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷走了他的蓝精灵  还是弄坏了他的机动战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicked all his Smurfs? Broke his Action Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.30,0:30:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.23,0:30:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都知道要发生什么  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know what's coming, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.41,0:30:37.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂不会罢休  他发誓要干掉他唯一的敌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty is obsessed, he's sworn to destroy his only rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.41,0:30:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你要我去照看你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want me to watch out for your brother 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.58,0:30:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为他不会接受你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he won't accept your help?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.98,0:30:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望不会太麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not too much trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.92,0:31:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 借过  - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.62,0:31:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  有件怪事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, something weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.73,0:31:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.37,0:31:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 绑架案  - 驻美大使路法斯·布卢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kidnapping. - Rufus Bruhl. The ambassador to the US. 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是在华盛顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Washington, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是他  是他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him, his children. 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦斯和克劳黛  一个七岁  一个九岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max and Claudette, age seven and nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.86,0:31:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在圣艾尔代茨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're at St Aldates.  
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨里郡的豪华寄宿学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Posh boarding place in Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.50,0:31:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学校放假  其他寄宿生都回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}School broke up, all the boarders went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.70,0:31:53.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有几个孩子留校  就包括他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few kids remained, including those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.55,0:31:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个孩子不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids have vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.73,0:31:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使亲自指名找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassador's asked for you personally. 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.16,0:31:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱辛巴赫英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Reichenbach hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.53,0:32:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟名人一起办案真不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it great to be working with a celebrity?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.87,0:32:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该很快就能放你走了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't need to keep you for much longer. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.63,0:32:21.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没事了  - 麦肯齐小姐是舍监  温柔点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right. - Miss MacKenzie, House Mistress. Go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦肯齐小姐  你负责学生的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss MacKenzie, you're in charge of pupil welfare,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.85,0:32:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可昨晚却有人轻易闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet you left this place wide open last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.60,0:32:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是白痴  喝醉了  还是同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, an idiot, a drunk or a criminal?! 
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.42,0:32:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻  迅速  回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, quickly, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.18,0:32:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门窗都关好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the doors and the windows were properly bolted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.94,0:32:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚没有任何人  包括我都没进过他们的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one, not even me, went into their room last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.21,0:32:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to believe me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.64,0:32:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信  我就是想让你快点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, I just wanted you to speak quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.32,0:32:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦肯齐小姐需要个口袋呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss MacKenzie will need to breath into a bag now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.44,0:32:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每学期六千块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six grand a term,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.71,0:32:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然还不能保证孩子的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd expect them to keep the kids safe for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.94,0:32:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说其他的孩子都放假走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the other kids had all left on their holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.75,0:32:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他们俩还住在这层楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were the only two sleeping on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.87,0:32:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没有强行闯入的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's absolutely no sign of a break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.88,0:33:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闯入者肯定是藏在什么地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intruder must have been hidden inside some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.45,0:33:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我去哥哥的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me where the brother slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.97,0:33:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小男孩每晚都睡在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy sleeps there every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.78,0:33:36.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盯着从走廊投进来的唯一光线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gazing at the only light source outside in the corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.36,0:33:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会认出每个人的形态和轮廓\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd recognise every shape, every outline,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个走到门前的人的剪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}the silhouette of everyone who came to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.58,0:33:42.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so? 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.68,0:33:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样  如果有一个他没见过的人走到门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if someone approaches the door who he doesn't recognise,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.80,0:33:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就知道是闯入者  或许他都能看到武器的轮廓\N{\fnArial\fs30}an intruder, maybe he can even see the outline of a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.80,0:33:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.60,0:33:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他们闯进来之前珍贵的几秒钟内\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the precious few seconds before they came into the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.53,0:33:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他如果没有大声呼救  会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}how would he use them if not to cry out?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.63,0:34:03.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个小男孩  就是这个小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little boy, this particular little boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.01,0:34:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他读了那么多间谍小说  他会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}who reads all of those spy books, what would he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.55,0:34:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留下什么标记吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd leave a sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.17,0:34:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫安德森来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.93,0:34:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚麻油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linseed oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.37,0:34:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么用  不能帮我们找到绑匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much use, it doesn't lead us to the kidnapper. 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.04,0:34:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错  安德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant, Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.14,0:34:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗  - 是啊  很不错地展现了白痴的风范\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yes, brilliant impression of an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.09,0:34:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为我们留下了足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He... made a trail for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.78,0:34:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男孩被逼着走在他们前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy was made to walk ahead of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.25,0:34:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  因为踮脚了吗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}On what, tiptoe? 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.49,0:34:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不安的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indicates anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.62,0:34:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人拿枪指着他的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun held to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.62,0:34:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩被人拉着侧身走在他旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl was pulled beside him, dragged sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.13,0:34:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他左胳膊架在她的脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had his left arm cradled about her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.58,0:34:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有了  我们不知道他们接下来去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the end of it, we don't know where they went from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.86,0:34:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底还是没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tells us nothing after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.20,0:35:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得对  安德森  是没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, Anderson, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.62,0:35:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只让我们知道他的鞋码  身高  步法和步速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except his shoe size, his height, his gait, his walking pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.72,0:35:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩得开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having fun? 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.30,0:35:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.23,0:35:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许还是别笑的好  毕竟有小孩被绑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe don't do the smiling. Kidnapped children?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.24,0:35:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果门都锁上了  他怎么躲过的监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he get past the CCTV? If all the doors were locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.92,0:35:35.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他门没锁的时候就进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He walked in when they weren't locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.09,0:35:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那种学校哪会让陌生人随意进出\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a stranger can't just walk into a school like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.18,0:35:40.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要时机对  任何人都能随意进出任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone can walk in anywhere if they pick the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.43,0:35:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天是期末\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, end of term,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.84,0:35:44.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处是家长  司机  员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}parents milling around, chauffeurs, staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:46.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们中间再混进个陌生人谁会察觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's one more stranger among that lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.56,0:35:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他伺机行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.34,0:35:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要找个好地方藏身即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he had to do was find a place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.01,0:36:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.80,0:36:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊  我正要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, I'm just going out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.82,0:36:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  你不出去  - 我午饭约了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you're not. - I've got a lunch date.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.28,0:36:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 取消吧  我们一起吃午餐  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cancel it, you're having lunch with me. - What? 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.38,0:36:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.38,0:36:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事关你一个前男友  我们正在追查他的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of your old boyfriends, we're trying to track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.27,0:36:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他近来有些捣蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been a bit naughty. 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.46,0:36:15.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是莫里亚蒂干的吗  - 当然是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Moriarty? - Of course it's Moriarty!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.49,0:36:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实金算不上是我男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim actually wasn't even my boyfriend, 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.01,0:36:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只约会过三次  我没再和他来往\N{\fnArial\fs30}we went out three times. I ended it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.04,0:36:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  然后他去偷走了王冠和权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, then he stole the Crown Jewels, 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.11,0:36:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闯进英国央行\N{\fnArial\fs30}broke into the Bank of England 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.04,0:36:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还组织了本顿维尔监狱的越狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and organised a prison break in Pentonville.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.58,0:36:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了维护法纪和秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the sake of law and order, 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.56,0:36:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我建议你将来就不要找男朋友了  茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you avoid all future attempts at a relationship, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.61,0:36:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些油渍  约翰  绑匪脚印里的油渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oil, John. The oil in the kidnapper's footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.77,0:36:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会帮我们找到莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll lead us to Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.82,0:36:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他鞋上所有的化学品都保存了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the chemical traces on his shoe have been preserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.31,0:36:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞋底就好像护照\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sole of the shoe is like a passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.44,0:36:44.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们走运  能查到他最近的全部行程\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're lucky, we'll see everything he's been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.23,0:36:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个需要做分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.53,0:36:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是碱性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alkaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.43,0:36:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你  约翰  - 是茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, John. - Molly. 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.48,0:36:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.93,0:37:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... o... u.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.98,0:37:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘油分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glycerol molecule.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.03,0:37:31.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.78,0:37:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说"我欠你"是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you mean, IOU?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.99,0:37:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚说"我欠你"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said IOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.65,0:37:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚一直在念叨这几个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were muttering it while you were working. 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.03,0:37:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么  记下来的东西罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, mental note.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.81,0:37:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有点像我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a bit like my dad. 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.79,0:37:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了  哦不  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead. No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.51,0:37:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茉莉  请不要觉得非得跟我搭讪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, please don't feel the need to make conversation, 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.27,0:37:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真不是你的强项\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's really not your area.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.47,0:37:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死前那段日子  总是很开心  心情愉悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he was dying, he was always cheerful, he was lovely,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:37:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他觉得没人看到他时就不是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}except when he thought no-one could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.52,0:38:02.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有次看到他的神情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him once, 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.70,0:38:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很哀伤  - 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- he looked sad. - Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.15,0:38:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就很哀伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look sad, 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.98,0:38:09.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他看不到的时候就很哀伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you think he can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.64,0:38:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧  别说你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you OK? And don't just say you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我知道那代表什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I know what that means,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.10,0:38:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得没人看到就流露哀伤的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking sad when you think no-one can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.36,0:38:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你就能看见我  - 我对你不算数\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can see me. - I don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.98,0:38:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想说  如果我能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm trying to say is, that if there's anything I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.21,0:38:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要我做任何事  我都会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything you need, anything at all, you can have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.93,0:38:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  我就是说  我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just mean, I mean, 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.23,0:38:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你需要我做什么事  我都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's anything you need, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.13,0:38:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我会需要你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what can I need from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.04,0:38:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.75,0:38:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实你大可只说句谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could probably say thank you, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.51,0:38:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.71,0:38:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去买点薯片吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to go and get some crisps. 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.62,0:38:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.02,0:38:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  我知道你不吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, I know you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.85,0:39:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其实  要不我...  - 我知道你不吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, actually, maybe I'll... - I know you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.97,0:39:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.43,0:39:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,箱子里的那个信封\N{\fnArial\fs30}This envelope that was in her trunk, 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.10,0:39:19.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有一个  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- there's another one. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.28,0:39:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天有人放在我们门阶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On our doorstep. Found it today. 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.57,0:39:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  你瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.92,0:39:29.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞧  是完全相同的封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that, exactly the same seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.45,0:39:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面包屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breadcrumbs.  
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.21,0:39:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来时就放在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was there when I got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.69,0:39:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面包屑留下的行迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little trace of breadcrumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.52,0:39:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那本精装童话书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardback copy of Fairy Tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.59,0:39:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个孩子被邪恶的父亲领进了林子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two children led into the forest by a wicked father,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.83,0:39:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跟着面包屑走\N{\fnArial\fs30}follow a little trail of breadcrumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.11,0:39:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是《糖果屋》的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Hansel and Gretel. 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的绑匪还留下线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of kidnapper leaves clues?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.91,0:39:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢自吹自擂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sort that likes to boast, 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.18,0:39:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这一切看作是游戏的绑匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sort that thinks it's all a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他坐在我们的公寓里  对我说的原话是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sat in our flat and he said these exact words to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.95,0:40:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个童话故事都要有个老派的坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}"All fairy tales need a good old-fashioned villain."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.21,0:40:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第五样物质  是童话的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fifth substance, it's part of the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.83,0:40:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 女巫的房子  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The witch's house. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.73,0:40:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘油分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glycerol molecule.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.91,0:40:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是聚甘油蓖麻醇酯\N{\fnArial\fs30}PGPR! 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.78,0:40:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么  - 是用来做巧克力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - It's used in making chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.05,0:40:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一小时前传真过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fax arrived an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:31.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你查到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.03,0:40:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在城里找出一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a place in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.97,0:40:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这五样东西交集的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where all five of these things intersect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.15,0:40:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白垩  沥青  砖尘  植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chalk, asphalt, brick dust, vegetation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.88,0:40:38.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么  巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? Chocolate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.92,0:40:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为我们要找的是一间废弃的糖果厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're looking for a disused sweet factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.93,0:40:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得缩小范围  有沥青的糖果厂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to narrow that down. A sweet factory with asphalt?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.07,0:40:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  还是太泛泛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, too general. 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.66,0:40:46.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得有更具体的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.36,0:40:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白垩  白垩质粘土  这能缩小地理范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chalk, chalky clay. That's a far thinner band of geology.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.53,0:40:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砖尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.99,0:40:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建筑工地  五十年代的砖头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Building site. Bricks from the 1950s.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.38,0:40:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦有几千个建筑工地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's thousands of building sites in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.91,0:41:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我派人出去找了  - 我也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got people out looking. - So have I!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.19,0:41:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流浪汉的信息网  比警方敏捷多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homeless network, faster than the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.62,0:41:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不介意收受贿赂\N{\fnArial\fs30}far more relaxed about taking bribes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.78,0:41:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.96,0:41:25.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彭土杜鹃  符合要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhododendron ponticum. Matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.95,0:41:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 阿德斯顿  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Addlestone. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.12,0:41:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,河岸和公园之间有一英里的废弃厂房\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a mile of disused factories between the river and the park,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.29,0:41:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,符合所有要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}it matches everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.92,0:41:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  行动  行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.50,0:41:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  你们去那边看\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, you look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.95,0:41:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要有疏漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.45,0:41:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家请散开  散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, spread out, please, spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.57,0:42:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚熄灭的  他们还在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was alight moments ago. They're still here! 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.16,0:42:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糖纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet wrappers?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.14,0:42:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给你们吃什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he been feeding you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.28,0:42:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汉塞尔和格莱特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hansel and Gretel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.16,0:42:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 水银  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mercury. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.46,0:42:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糖纸  上面涂了水银  是有毒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The papers, they're painted with mercury, lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.52,0:42:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们吃得越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more they ate...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.63,0:42:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会要了他们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was killing them. 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.44,0:42:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是单个不足以致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not enough to kill them on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.44,0:42:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果摄入足够多的量  最终会导致他们死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken in large enough quantities, eventually it would kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.82,0:42:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不需要亲自来行刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't need to be there for the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.02,0:42:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥控杀人  他可以待在千里之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder by remote control, he could be 1,000 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.99,0:42:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们越饿  吃得越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hungrier they got, the more they ate,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.38,0:42:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就死得越快  真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}the faster they died. Neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.62,0:42:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 控制一下  - 在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock. - Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.91,0:42:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会照顾他  别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got him, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.33,0:43:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  专业人士都问完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then, the professionals are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.46,0:43:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是外行还想进去自己问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the amateurs want to go in and have their turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.12,0:43:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住  她受了惊吓  而且只有七岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember, she's in shock and she's just seven years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.71,0:43:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  如果你能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, anything you can do to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.96,0:43:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别太夏洛克吗  - 对  可能会比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not be myself? - Yeah, might be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.45,0:43:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳黛  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claudette, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.22,0:43:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  我知道你很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I know it's been hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.82,0:43:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克劳黛  听着  - 出去  出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Claudette, listen to me. - Out. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.00,0:43:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这没道理啊  - 孩子受惊过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Makes no sense. - Kid's traumatised.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.55,0:43:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克某些地方让她想起那个绑匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about Sherlock reminds her of the kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.20,0:43:42.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she said?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.52,0:43:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个字都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't uttered another syllable.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.25,0:43:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那个男孩呢  - 还是昏迷不醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the boy? - No, he's unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.10,0:43:47.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仍在重症监护中\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still in intensive care.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.55,0:44:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别往心里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't let it get to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.49,0:44:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次看你进门  我都想尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always feel like screaming when you walk into a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.33,0:44:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话很多人都有同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, so do most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.47,0:44:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.04,0:44:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只凭脚印你就找到了那些孩子  了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant work you did finding those kids from just a footprint,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.87,0:44:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.20,0:44:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:21.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.99,0:44:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗  - 在思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You OK? - Thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.07,0:44:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我坐这辆  你等下辆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my cab, you get the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.21,0:44:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么  - 你会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - You might talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.71,0:44:56.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"这是巧克力吗"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Is this chocolate?"
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.62,0:44:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我们要找的是一间废弃的糖果厂"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We're looking for a disused sweet factory."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.88,0:45:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"出去"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Get out!"
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.50,0:45:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.86,0:45:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦出租车购物广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stunning evening wear
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.06,0:45:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为您呈现这套华美的晚装配饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}set from us here at London Taxi Shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.28,0:45:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把它关掉好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you turn this off, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.28,0:45:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如您所见  本套商品包括一副美丽的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, the set comprises of a beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.88,0:45:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这关掉行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you turn this off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.02,0:45:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搭配四条镶嵌式钻石手链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accompanied by four spangly diamond bracelets...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.30,0:45:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.94,0:45:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好听故事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready for the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.82,0:45:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是自夸骑士的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the story of Sir Boast-a-lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.51,0:45:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个脚印  这就是他全部的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}A footprint, it's all he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.25,0:45:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}A footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.31,0:45:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  你也知道他的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you know what he's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.25,0:45:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝克街犯罪现场调查专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}CSI Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.92,0:45:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我们的人就做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, our boys couldn't have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.31,0:45:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们需要他  他更厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's why we need him, he's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.45,0:45:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是一种解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.46,0:45:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有别的解释吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.59,0:45:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自夸骑士是圆桌骑士中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Boast-a-lot was the bravest
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.26,0:45:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最勇敢  也是最聪明的骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cleverest knight at the round table.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.92,0:46:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其他骑士逐渐开始厌倦他那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But soon the other knights began to grow tired of his stories
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.34,0:46:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲述他多么英勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how brave he was
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.92,0:46:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,颂扬他屠龙伟业的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how many dragons he'd slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.13,0:46:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快他们就开始怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon they began to wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.84,0:46:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自夸爵士的故事究竟是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Are Sir Boast-a-lot's stories even true?"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.17,0:46:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他能找到那些证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only he could have found that evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.43,0:46:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.89,0:46:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女孩看到他时  叫得撕心裂肺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl screams her head off when she sees him...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.37,0:46:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可从来没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man she has never seen before,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.33,0:46:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非她以前见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless she had seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.78,0:46:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.63,0:46:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我想说什么  你只是不想相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is, you just don't want to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.19,0:46:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是所有的骑士都去对亚瑟王说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all of the knights went to King Arthur and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.90,0:46:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我不相信自夸骑士的故事"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I don't believe Sir Boast-a-lot's stories."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.94,0:46:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"他就是个大骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He's just a big old liar...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.09,0:46:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己编故事  好显得很了不起"\N{\fnArial\fs30}who makes things up to make himself look good."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.57,0:46:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不会真以为是他干的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not seriously suggesting he's involved, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.12,0:46:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为我们得考虑这种可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we have to entertain the possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.18,0:46:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来  甚至连国王也开始怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, even the King began to wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.76,0:47:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但自夸骑士的麻烦还没完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that wasn't the end of Sir Boast-a-lot's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.99,0:47:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.78,0:47:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的麻烦还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't the final problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.73,0:47:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事讲完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.28,0:47:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.85,0:47:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.17,0:47:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.76,0:47:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.83,0:47:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.32,0:47:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.29,0:47:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.24,0:47:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.10,0:48:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他  是那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is him. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.07,0:48:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫苏莱曼尼什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulejmani or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.51,0:48:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考夫给我看过他的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft showed me his file.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.05,0:48:06.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔巴尼亚来的大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a big Albanian gangster,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.72,0:48:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住的地方跟我们只隔两户\N{\fnArial\fs30}lives two doors down from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.86,0:48:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他因为跟我握手而被杀  - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He died because I shook his hand. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.73,0:48:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他救了我的命  却不能碰我  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life, but he couldn't touch me. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.39,0:48:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家门口住着四个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four assassins living right on our doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.19,0:48:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是来杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't come here to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.27,0:48:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们必须保住我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to keep me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.66,0:48:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手上有他们都想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got something that all of them want.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.27,0:48:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果他们中任何一个接近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if one of them approaches me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.33,0:48:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人就会杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others kill them before they can get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.88,0:48:32.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有注意力都在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of the attention is focused on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.07,0:48:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一张监控网正死死地盯着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a surveillance web closing in on us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.89,0:48:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你手上究竟有什么东西这么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what have you got that's so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.73,0:48:43.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得问问除尘的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to ask about the dusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.03,0:48:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要精确的细节  上个星期哪里被清扫过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precise details, in the last week, what's been cleaned?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.05,0:48:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星期二  我清理了你的地毯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesday, I did your lino.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.43,0:48:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是这里  我们要在这个房间找\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, in here, this room, this is where we'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.22,0:48:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何灰尘被擦拭的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any break in the dust line.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.56,0:48:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都能归位  但灰尘不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can put back anything but dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.48,0:48:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灰尘即铁证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dust is eloquent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.66,0:48:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这是要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.86,0:48:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找摄像头  我们被监视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cameras, we're being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.55,0:49:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  摄像头  在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Cameras? Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.14,0:49:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我穿着睡衣呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in my nightie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.87,0:49:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  探长  - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Inspector. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.61,0:49:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的回答是不  - 我什么都没问呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The answer's no. - You've not heard the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.89,0:49:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想把我带到警署去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to take me to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.25,0:49:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不麻烦你开口问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saving you the trouble of asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.79,0:49:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.48,0:49:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 因为那声尖叫  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The scream? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.52,0:49:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁说的  多诺万  肯定是多诺万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it? Donovan? I bet it was Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.64,0:49:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是否与绑架案有牵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Am I somehow responsible for the kidnapping?"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.26,0:49:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty is smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.37,0:49:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在她脑海里植入怀疑的种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He planted that doubt in her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.45,0:49:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种感觉萦绕不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little nagging sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.77,0:49:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to have to be strong to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.39,0:49:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没法扼杀一种想法  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill an idea, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.54,0:49:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要它在这里  生根发芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not once it's made a home... there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.47,0:49:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会跟我走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.40,0:49:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的下一步棋  是一张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}One photograph, that's his next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.54,0:49:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.45,0:49:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先是孩子的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}First the scream,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.36,0:50:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后是我被带去问讯的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}then a photograph of me being taken in for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.82,0:50:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想一点一点地毁了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to destroy me inch by inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.55,0:50:06.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一场游戏  雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a game, Lestrade,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.97,0:50:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我并不想参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not one I'm willing to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.23,0:50:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代我向多诺万警佐问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give my regards to Sergeant Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.35,0:50:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们会作出决定  - 什么决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They'll be deciding. - Deciding?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.18,0:50:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是否带着逮捕令回来抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether to come back with a warrant and arrest me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.77,0:50:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你这么觉得吗  - 这是标准程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think? - Standard procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.26,0:50:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该跟他走  别人会以为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have gone with him. People'll think...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.74,0:50:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不在乎别人怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.66,0:50:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不想让他们认为你很蠢  或犯了错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd care if they thought you were stupid or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.34,0:51:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是他们蠢  他们犯了错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that would just make them stupid or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.94,0:51:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  我不想让这个世界以为你是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, I don't want the world believing you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.07,0:51:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I am what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.37,0:51:12.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.67,0:51:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你担心他们是对的  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're worried they're right. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.38,0:51:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你担心他们对我的判断是对的  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That they're right about me. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.92,0:51:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你烦躁的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.74,0:51:20.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不敢去想  他们或许是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't entertain the possibility they may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.89,0:51:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你害怕自己也受了骗  - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're afraid you've been taken in as well. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.49,0:51:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂也在玩弄你的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty is playing with your mind, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.33,0:51:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你难道看不出是怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you SEE what's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.83,0:51:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我认识的是真实的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know you for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.43,0:51:33.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百分之百吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.30,0:51:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁会一直假装成这么个讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nobody could fake being such an annoying dick all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.19,0:51:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克·福尔摩斯  - 是的  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock Holmes? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.79,0:51:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媒体上经常报道的那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bloke that's been in the press?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.92,0:51:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为他是个私家侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was some sort of private eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.28,0:51:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是的  - 我们一直都在向他咨询\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is. - We've been consulting with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.07,0:51:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这个意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what you're telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.79,0:51:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有让他插手过机要案件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not used him on any proper cases though, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.63,0:51:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那么一两个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.20,0:52:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是二三十个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or 20 or 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.91,0:52:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.51,0:52:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是只有我这么做  格雷格森...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the only senior officer who did this. Gregson...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.16,0:52:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.42,0:52:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个业余侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}An amateur detective
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.94,0:52:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然能接触到各种机密信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}given access to all sorts of classified information.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.56,0:52:13.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他还是一个案件的疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's a suspect in a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.61,0:52:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 恕我直言  - 你这个白痴  雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With all due respect... - You're a bloody idiot, Lestrade!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.69,0:52:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在马上去把他抓来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go and fetch him in, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.55,0:52:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.54,0:52:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你们得意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proud of yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.84,0:52:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不止这一个案子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what if it's not just this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.68,0:52:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是每次他都是在耍我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he's done this to us every single time?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.05,0:52:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警局里还是有人护着我们的  是雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, still got some friends on the force. It's Lestrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.33,0:52:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说他们正赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says they're all coming over here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.60,0:52:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有被你弄得没面子的警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queuing up to slap on the handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.41,0:52:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都排着队要来拷你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every officer you've ever made feel like a tit,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.51,0:52:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是不少人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.45,0:52:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  是不是打扰你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.60,0:53:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人送来一个包裹  我给忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some chap delivered a parcel, I forgot,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.84,0:53:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面标记说易腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}marked perishable.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.00,0:53:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只好签收了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to sign for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.31,0:53:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字挺滑稽  是德语  像是童话里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny name, German, like the fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.97,0:53:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烧焦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burnt to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.24,0:53:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.69,0:53:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 警察  - 我去开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Police! - I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.96,0:53:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.87,0:53:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  赫德森太太  - 我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, Mrs Hudson. - We need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.92,0:53:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别就这么闯进来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't barge in like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.68,0:53:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有逮捕令吗  有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got a warrant? Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.84,0:53:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别插手  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.37,0:53:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲点礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.54,0:53:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯  我现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes, I'm arresting you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.79,0:53:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以涉嫌诱拐和绑架的罪名逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}on suspicion of abduction and kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.56,0:53:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没关系  约翰  - 他没有反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's OK, John. - He's not resisting...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.36,0:53:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  这怎么会没关系  这太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not all right, this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.35,0:53:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在带他下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him downstairs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.04,0:53:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真不该这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.96,0:53:52.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别妨碍公务  不然我连你一起逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to interfere or I shall arrest you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.62,0:53:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你满意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.54,0:53:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.24,0:54:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们初次见面的时候  - 算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- First time we met. - Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.64,0:54:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会满足于破案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solving crimes won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.19,0:54:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天  他会越过底线\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day he'll cross the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.53,0:54:08.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己想想  什么人会去绑架孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now ask yourself, what sort of man would kidnap those kids
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.74,0:54:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了通过找回他们来显摆自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so he can impress us all by finding them?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.28,0:54:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 多诺万  - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Donovan? - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.57,0:54:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 人抓住了吗  - 是的  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got our man? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.69,0:54:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说的话  一看就是个怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked a bit of a weirdo, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.17,0:54:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种义警通常都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Often are, these vigilante types.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.53,0:54:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.20,0:54:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.51,0:54:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来跟我作伴了  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joining me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.02,0:54:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然打总警司一拳是违法行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apparently it's against the law to chin the Chief Superintendent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.86,0:54:39.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不太聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit awkward this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.78,0:54:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下没人来保释我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no-one to bail us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.29,0:54:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我更倾向于现在就大胆逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking more about our imminent and daring escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.71,0:54:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所有单位到27区  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All units to 27. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.98,0:54:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有单位到2\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units to 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.13,0:54:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们  先生们  请你们跪下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, will you all please get on your knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.84,0:55:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在就跪下  - 照他说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- NOW would be good! - Do as he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.02,0:55:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说明一下  枪是他夺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you're aware, the gun is his idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.38,0:55:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是个  你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a... you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.42,0:55:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.95,0:55:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人质  没错  这个可以有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostage, yes, that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.24,0:55:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个可以有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That works.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.33,0:55:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.01,0:55:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如莫里亚蒂所愿  做个逃犯  跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing what Moriarty wants, becoming a fugitive. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.37,0:55:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追上他  雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get after him, Lestrade!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.89,0:55:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.18,0:55:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下肯定要被人说闲话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now people will definitely talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.00,0:55:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 枪掉了  - 别管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The gun! - Leave it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.40,0:55:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.44,0:55:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得协调一致才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to need to coordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.14,0:55:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往右边去  往你右边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your right. Go to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.52,0:55:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都宁可信其有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wants to believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.92,0:55:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是高明之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what makes it so clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.48,0:55:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个比真相更受人青睐的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lie that's preferable to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.50,0:55:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的演绎法是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My deductions were a sham.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.08,0:55:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都舒坦了  夏洛克毫无过人之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one feels inadequate, Sherlock's an ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.68,0:56:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考夫  他能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, he could help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.45,0:56:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在真不是打亲情牌的好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big family reconciliation, now's not really the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.82,0:56:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.23,0:56:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人跟来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.10,0:56:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道躲不过警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew we couldn't outrun the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.43,0:56:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.29,0:56:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是咱们贝克街上的新邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's one of my new neighbours from Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.82,0:56:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他能不能给我们答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if he can give us some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.32,0:56:23.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.93,0:56:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要冲到那辆巴士前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to jump in front of that bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.53,0:56:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想从我这里得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you want from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.04,0:56:41.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.60,0:56:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他放在你公寓里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left it at your flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.42,0:56:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁  - 莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.14,0:56:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.44,0:56:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 程序代码  - 这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The computer key code. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.64,0:56:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他公开售卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.80,0:56:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闯进伦敦塔的程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}The programme he used to break into the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.59,0:56:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他来的那天动的手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He planted it when he came around.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.12,0:57:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可以扭转局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a game-changer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.31,0:57:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这把钥匙  能攻破任何系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a key, it can break into any system
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.20,0:57:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此时此刻就在我们公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's sitting in our flat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.47,0:57:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他留下那个信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he left that message,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.96,0:57:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉大家该去哪里  "去找夏洛克"\N{\fnArial\fs30}telling everyone where to come, "Get Sherlock!"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.87,0:57:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须回公寓找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get back into the flat and search.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.81,0:57:28.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刑事调查局在那儿守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}CID will be camped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.71,0:57:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么栽赃给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why plant it on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.59,0:57:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一个搞坏我名声的歪点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's another subtle way of smearing my name,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.50,0:57:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我跟那些罪犯成了好哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}now I'm best pals with all those criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.59,0:57:37.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, have you seen this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.72,0:57:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大爆料\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kiss-and-tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.67,0:57:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个叫理查·布鲁克的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bloke called Rich Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.54,0:57:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.08,0:58:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在发表声明是不是太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late to go on the record?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.33,0:58:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜了  《夏洛克·福尔摩斯的真相》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, "The Truth About Sherlock Holmes."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.74,0:58:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都想要的独家  而你搞到了  漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scoop that everybody wanted and you got it. Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.20,0:58:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给过你机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you your opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.02,0:58:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本想站在你这边  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to be on your side, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.00,0:58:27.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拒绝了我  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned me down, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.49,0:58:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就有大惊喜  有人爆出猛料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then lo and behold, someone spills all the beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.20,0:58:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是心想事成  布鲁克是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}How utterly convenient. Who is Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.12,0:58:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧  姬蒂  鬼才相信电话爆料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kitty, no-one trusts the voice at the end of a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.40,0:58:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无疑问  咖啡馆里秘密碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those furtive little meetings in cafes,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.64,0:58:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酒店房间里会谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}those sessions in the hotel room
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.80,0:58:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对着录音笔侃侃而谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he gabbled into your Dictaphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.24,0:58:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么就相信他了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that you can trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.95,0:58:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个揣着圣杯冒出来的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man turns up with the Holy Grail in his pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.07,0:58:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是怎么让你信服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were his credentials?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.86,0:58:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  买不到咖啡粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, they didn't have any ground coffee,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.52,0:58:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就买了普通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I just got normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.47,0:59:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过他们不可能找到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that they wouldn't find me here,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.88,0:59:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过我在这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said that I'd be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.25,0:59:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.13,0:59:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理查  我是证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard, I'm a witness,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.14,0:59:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会当着证人的面伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wouldn't harm you in front of witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.63,0:59:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的爆料人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's your source?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.77,0:59:13.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂就是理查·布鲁克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty is Richard Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.53,0:59:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是理查·布鲁克  不存在莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he's Richard Brook, there is no Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.84,0:59:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来就没有这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There never has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.96,0:59:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说什么胡话  - 去查查吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - Look him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.28,0:59:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理查·布鲁克  夏洛克雇来扮演莫里亚蒂的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich Brook, an actor Sherlock Holmes hired to be Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.37,0:59:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华生医生  我知道你是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Watson, I know you're a good man,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.13,0:59:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  不要伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't, don't, don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.29,0:59:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对  你是莫里亚蒂  他就是莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you are Moriarty! He's Moriarty!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.55,0:59:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们见过  记得吗  你想把我炸死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've met, remember? You were going to blow me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.06,0:59:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.36,0:59:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他出钱雇我  而我需要活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He paid me, I needed the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.12,0:59:48.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个演员  我失业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an actor, I was out of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.48,0:59:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  你最好解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, you'd better explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.19,0:59:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全搞不懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I am not getting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来解释吧  白纸黑字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be doing the explaining, in print.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.51,0:59:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全在这里  板上钉钉的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all here, conclusive proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.55,1:00:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你虚构出金姆斯·莫里亚蒂  所谓的夙敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You invented James Moriarty, your nemesis.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.03,1:00:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚构出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invented him?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.10,1:00:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上所有的案子都是他策划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He invented all the crimes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.93,1:00:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最厉害的是凭空造出一位犯罪大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to cap it all, he made up a master villain.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.54,1:00:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这太扯了  - 问他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be ridiculous! - Ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.45,1:00:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就在这里  问他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right here. Just ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.30,1:00:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 告诉他  理查  - 得了吧  他上过庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell him, Richard. - For God's sake, this man was on trial!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.89,1:00:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  就是你付钱让他背黑锅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and you paid him, pay him to take the rap.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.56,1:00:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还保证搞定陪审团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promised you'd rig the jury.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.06,1:00:21.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不是伦敦西区的角色  但我猜钱也不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly a West End role, but I'll bet the money was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.32,1:00:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不够多  否则他不会爆料\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not so good he didn't want to sell his story.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.44,1:00:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  真的  非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. I am. I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.66,1:00:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备发表的就是这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the story you're going to publish?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.92,1:00:31.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后的结论就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big conclusion of it all,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.58,1:00:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂只是个演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty's an actor?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.91,1:00:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他心里明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.92,1:00:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有证据  有证据  给他们看...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have proof. I have proof. Show them...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.94,1:00:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姬蒂  给他们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitty, show them something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.91,1:00:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  拿出来我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, show me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.60,1:00:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上过电视  是儿童频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on TV. I'm on kids' TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.03,1:00:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讲故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the story-teller.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.46,1:00:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讲故事  出过DVD\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the story-teller. It's on DVD.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.15,1:01:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.60,1:01:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正都这样了  不用瞒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all coming out. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.74,1:01:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他们  说啊  说啊  还瞒什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell them. Just tell them. Tell them! It's all over now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.78,1:01:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  别碰我  你休想碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't you touch me! Don't you lay a finger on me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你耍够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.20,1:01:14.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别伤害我  - 别让他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't hurt me! - Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.99,1:01:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.48,1:01:22.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  他肯定有后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. He'll have back-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.94,1:01:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗  夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what, Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.73,1:01:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在算是看透你了  你让我恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look at you know and I can read you... and you repel me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.43,1:01:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.97,1:01:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底改变身份  把你抹黑成罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completely change his identity, make you the criminal?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.90,1:01:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他彻底掌握了我的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got my whole life story.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.46,1:01:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想兜售一个天大的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you do when you sell a big lie,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.92,1:01:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将其包裹在真相之中  看上去无懈可击\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wrap it up in the truth to make it more palatable.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.01,1:01:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是你的一家之言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be your word against his.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.45,1:01:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他用一天时间在人们脑袋里埋下怀疑的种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been sowing doubt into people's minds for 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.56,1:01:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one thing he needs to do 
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.64,1:01:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能结束这场游戏  那就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}to complete his game and that...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.67,1:01:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.05,1:02:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.31,1:02:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事  我能帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Can I help?  
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.92,1:02:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我得一个人干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.89,1:02:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前说错了  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.14,1:02:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你算数的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do count.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.89,1:02:28.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直都算数  我始终相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always counted and I've always trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.63,1:02:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你也说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.58,1:02:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.90,1:02:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.83,1:02:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茉莉  我可能快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, I think I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.94,1:02:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.83,1:02:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不是你所以为的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wasn't everything that you think I am,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.31,1:02:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至不是我所以为的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that I think I am...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.27,1:02:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还愿意帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you still want to help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.57,1:02:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.79,1:03:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.88,1:03:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真的做了不少功课  那个莱利小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has really done her homework, Miss Riley,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.45,1:03:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些事只有和夏洛克最亲近的人才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's things that only someone close to Sherlock could know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.10,1:03:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最近有没有看过你弟弟的通讯录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen your brother's address book lately?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.43,1:03:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有两个名字  你跟我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two names... yours and mine...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.44,1:03:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而莫里亚蒂不是从我这里得到的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Moriarty didn't get this stuff from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.63,1:03:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  - 怎么回事  你们什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John... - So how does it work, your relationship?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.55,1:03:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是不是偶尔出去喝喝咖啡  你跟金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you go out for a coffee now and then, you and Jim?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.54,1:03:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的亲弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own brother
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.47,1:03:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把他的生平故事都告诉了这个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you blabbed about his entire life to this maniac.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.05,1:04:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本没打算...我根本没想过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never intend... I never dreamt...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.12,1:04:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时就是想跟我说这件事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This... this is what you were trying to tell me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.01,1:04:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"照看好他  因为我犯了个错"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Watch his back because I've made a mistake."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.32,1:04:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么认识他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you meet him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.16,1:04:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这样的人  我们了解并且监控他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like him, we know about them, we watch them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.97,1:04:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是金姆斯·莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But James Moriarty...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.43,1:04:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有前所未有的犯罪头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most dangerous criminal mind the world has ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.95,1:04:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及最终极的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, in his pocket, the ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.95,1:04:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,程序代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key code.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.84,1:04:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,区区几行程序就能畅通无阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few lines of computer code that can unlock any door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.88,1:04:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为了套出代码  绑架了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you abducted him to try and find the key code?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.49,1:04:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们审问了他数周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interrogated him for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.03,1:04:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 结果呢  - 他不合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - He wouldn't play along.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.80,1:04:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just sat there
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.82,1:04:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凝视着黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}staring into the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.84,1:05:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一能让他开口的是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that made him open up...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.21,1:05:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以让他说话  就一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could get him to talk, just a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.25,1:05:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.99,1:05:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为回报  你得告诉他夏洛克的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return you had to offer him Sherlock's life story.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.98,1:05:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  这个天大的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, one big lie...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.83,1:05:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock's a fraud,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.58,1:05:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们会相信  因为别的部分都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and people will swallow it because the rest of it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.54,1:05:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂想要毁了夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty wanted Sherlock destroyed, right,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.62,1:05:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你给他送去了最强力的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have given him the perfect ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.47,1:05:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.49,1:05:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.14,1:05:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.71,1:05:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转告他  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.48,1:06:10.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我收到你的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your message.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.85,1:06:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,程序代码是问题的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}The computer code is the key to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.19,1:06:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它找出来并使用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find it, we can use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.99,1:06:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用莫里亚蒂的方式击败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat Moriarty in his own game.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.67,1:06:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说使用是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean use it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.39,1:06:16.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他用来编造了一个假身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used it to create a false identity
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.68,1:06:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也能篡改记录  销毁理查·布鲁克\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can break into the records and destroy Richard Brook.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.36,1:06:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把金·莫里亚蒂逼回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring back Jim Moriarty again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.92,1:06:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他无罪释放那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in 221b,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.28,1:06:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把代码藏在了221B的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}somewhere on the day of the verdict he left it hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.92,1:06:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他碰过什么  - 一个苹果  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he touch? - An apple, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.99,1:06:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他写了什么吗  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he write anything down? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.07,1:07:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我  请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.09,1:07:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.25,1:07:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  她没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Is she OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.28,1:07:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧  好  我这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God! Right, yes, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.17,1:07:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么事  - 是医护人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.23,1:07:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赫德森太太受到了枪击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson's been shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.53,1:07:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? How?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.26,1:07:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没准是你引来的那些杀手  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably one of the killers you managed to attract. Jesus! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.61,1:07:42.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不行了  夏洛克  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dying, Sherlock. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.98,1:07:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去  我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go. I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.92,1:07:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 忙  - 思考  我需要思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Busy?! - Thinking. I need to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.22,1:07:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要...你一点都不关心她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to...? Doesn't she mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.10,1:07:51.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上回有人碰了碰她  你就差点把他杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once half-killed a man because he laid a finger on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.44,1:07:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她是我房东  - 她快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's my landlady. - She's dying...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.53,1:07:55.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太冷血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you machine!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.86,1:07:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活见鬼  随你便  你就自己留在这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sod this. Sod this! You stay here if you want, on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.75,1:08:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只有孤独作伴  孤独能保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone is what I have. Alone protects me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.51,1:08:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对  保护我们的是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, friends protect people.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.80,1:08:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.33,1:08:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}here we are at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.01,1:08:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就我们俩  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.88,1:08:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的难题  最终的难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our problem... the final problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.47,1:08:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staying alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.32,1:08:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无聊透顶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so boring, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.49,1:09:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一成不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just staying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.18,1:09:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子都在找乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my life I've been searching for distractions
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.01,1:09:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾经那么有趣  现在连你也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were the best distraction and now I don't even have you
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.11,1:09:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我打败了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I've beaten you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.93,1:09:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.29,1:09:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到底  太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, it was easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.62,1:09:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.04,1:09:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能回去找普通人玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've got to go back to playing with the ordinary people,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.96,1:09:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而到头来  你也不过和他们一样是个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it turns out you're ordinary, just like all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.86,1:09:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.73,1:09:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是开始怀疑我是不是真的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you almost start to wonder if I was real?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.52,1:09:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是也被我耍了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I nearly get you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.47,1:09:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理查·布鲁克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard Brook.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.21,1:09:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人看出其中的亮点  但你看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody seems to get the joke, but you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.99,1:09:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然了  - 真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.06,1:09:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理查·布鲁克的德语就是莱辛巴赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard Brook in German is Reichenbach.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.67,1:09:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个让我出名的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The case that made my name. 
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.06,1:09:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是觉得这样很好玩啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.56,1:09:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊  你这也看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. You got that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数字一样的节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats like digits.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.60,1:10:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一拍就是1  其余的都是0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every beat is a one, every rest is a zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.48,1:10:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二进制代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Binary code.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.87,1:10:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以那些杀手都要救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why all those assassins tried to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.48,1:10:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代码就藏在我身上  藏在我脑海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was hidden on me, hidden inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.13,1:10:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几行简单的程序代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few simple lines of computer code
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.95,1:10:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以破解任何系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can break into any system.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.25,1:10:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对那些客户说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told all my clients, 
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.73,1:10:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后找上夏洛克的是胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}last one to Sherlock is a sissy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.60,1:10:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在我都知道了  我能用这个修改记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that it's up here, I can use it to alter all the records.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.35,1:10:31.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能抹杀理查·布鲁克  弄回金·莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can kill Rich Brook and bring back Jim Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.24,1:10:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  这也太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. This is too easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.79,1:10:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is too easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.45,1:10:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就没什么代码  笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no key, doofus!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.43,1:10:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些数字毫无意义  一点意义都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those digits are meaningless. They're utterly meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.57,1:10:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会真以为几行程序代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really think a couple of lines of computer code
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.61,1:10:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能破解全世界的系统吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are going to crash the world around our ears?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.52,1:10:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好失望哦  普通人夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm disappointed in you, ordinary Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.39,1:10:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那个节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the rhythm... 
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.57,1:11:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巴赫的1号协奏曲  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partita no 1! Thank you, Johann Sebastian Bach.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.47,1:11:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你又是怎么...  - 怎么黑进银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But then how did you... ? - How did I break into the bank,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.14,1:11:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦塔  还有监狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Tower, to the prison?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.66,1:11:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光天化日下的抢劫  只要有同伙就行啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daylight robbery! All it takes is some willing participants.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.87,1:11:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你会上钩  这是你的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd fall for it. That's your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.24,1:11:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是把事情想得很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always want everything to be clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.80,1:11:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的游戏能结束了吗  最后一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we finish the game? One final act.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.96,1:11:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好你选了一栋高楼  那样做效果很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you chose a tall building. Nice way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.85,1:11:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做  做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it? Do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.81,1:11:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.38,1:11:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.79,1:11:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天才侦探是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genius detective proved to be a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.15,1:11:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在报纸上看到  肯定是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read it in the paper so it must be true.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.93,1:11:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最爱报纸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love newspapers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.50,1:11:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有童话故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.08,1:11:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其喜欢黑暗的童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pretty grim ones too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.24,1:12:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  约翰  你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, John, you made me jump. 
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.05,1:12:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察那边没事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything OK with the police?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.64,1:12:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克都解决了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Sherlock sorted it all out?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.03,1:12:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.81,1:12:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.07,1:12:22.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出租车  等等  我是警察  算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi! No, no, no. Police... sort of!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.97,1:12:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了  伙计  太谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, mate. Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.64,1:12:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能证明你伪造了那个假身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can prove that you created an entirely false identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.36,1:12:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就自杀吧  那样省力多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill yourself. It's a lot less effort.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.04,1:12:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.30,1:12:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.12,1:12:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.94,1:12:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.80,1:12:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just getting that now? Wo-wo-wo!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.82,1:12:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.91,1:12:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再给你点动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a little extra incentive.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.86,1:12:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你不跳  你朋友就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends will die if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.77,1:13:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  - 不止是约翰  还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John? - Not just John. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.07,1:13:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 赫德森太太  - 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mrs Hudson? - Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.76,1:13:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade?  
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.32,1:13:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三发子弹  三个杀手  三人受死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three bullets, three gunmen, three victims.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.71,1:13:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人能阻止他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no stopping them now...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.32,1:13:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非他们看到你跳楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless my people see you jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.54,1:13:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管逮捕我  折磨我好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have me arrested, you can torture me,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.88,1:13:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想拿我怎么样随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can do anything you like with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.93,1:13:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没什么能阻止他们扣下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing's going to prevent them from pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.78,1:13:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这世上唯一的三个朋友死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your only three friends in the world will die unless...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.43,1:13:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 除非  - 我自杀  成就你的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unless... - I kill myself and complete your story.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.22,1:13:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得承认  这样更吸引人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to admit, that's sexier.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.86,1:13:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我声名狼藉地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I die in disgrace. 
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.11,1:13:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了  就是这个目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. That's the point of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.81,1:13:53.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在有观众了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got an audience now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.28,1:13:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off you pop.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.67,1:13:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.85,1:14:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你故事的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you how this ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.04,1:14:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你死  杀手才会收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your death is the only thing that's going to call off the killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.70,1:14:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certainly not going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.65,1:14:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能给我点时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give me one moment, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.20,1:14:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我一个人待会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}One moment of privacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.05,1:14:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.11,1:14:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.34,1:14:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.46,1:14:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.85,1:14:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.56,1:15:04.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.04,1:15:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么还是有办法让杀手收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the killers can be called off,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.14,1:15:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个代码  暗号或数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}then there's a recall code or a word or a number.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.37,1:15:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to die
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.09,1:15:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不用死\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.52,1:15:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得你能逼我让他们住手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can make me stop the order?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.37,1:15:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得你能做到吗  - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think you can make me do that? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.88,1:15:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you.  
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.72,1:15:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  你哥哥和整个政府的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, your big brother and all the King's horses
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.18,1:15:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不能逼我做我不想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't make me do a thing I didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.15,1:15:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但我不是我哥哥  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I'm not my brother, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.58,1:15:36.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.40,1:15:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepared to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.66,1:15:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好毁灭一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepared to burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.79,1:15:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好做普通人做不到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepared to do what ordinary people won't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.32,1:15:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想和我在地狱里相见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to shake hands with you in hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.08,1:15:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我奉陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall not disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.77,1:15:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.99,1:15:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这话说大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk big.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.06,1:15:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.41,1:15:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.33,1:16:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是普通人  你站在正义那一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ordinary. You're on the side of the angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.56,1:16:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也许是站在正义那一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be on the side of the angels,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.43,1:16:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这绝不代表我和他们是一种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't think for one second that I am one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.85,1:16:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.07,1:16:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.70,1:16:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.90,1:16:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.19,1:16:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.04,1:16:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.85,1:16:45.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.51,1:16:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.52,1:16:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.26,1:17:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.41,1:17:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.32,1:17:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I'm alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.55,1:17:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就能救你的朋友  你就会有退路\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can save your friends, you've got a way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.01,1:17:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就祝你好运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.11,1:17:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.09,1:17:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  先生  谢谢  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Thank you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.81,1:18:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.16,1:18:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  - 夏洛克  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - Hey, Sherlock. Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.45,1:18:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 转过身  往回走  - 我这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn around and walk back the way you came. - I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.60,1:18:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do as I ask!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.81,1:18:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.91,1:18:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.22,1:18:55.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.89,1:18:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克  - 好了  抬头  我在屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock? - OK, look up. I'm on the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.52,1:19:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.56,1:19:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能下来  所以我们只能这么说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I can't come down, so we'll just have to do it like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.92,1:19:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.33,1:19:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}An apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.97,1:19:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all true.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.67,1:19:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.47,1:19:19.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说的关于我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything they said about me. 
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.87,1:19:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我创造了莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invented Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.79,1:19:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you saying this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.50,1:19:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.48,1:19:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克  - 报纸上写的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock... - The newspapers were right all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.78,1:19:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你告诉雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to tell Lestrade,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.17,1:19:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉赫德森太太和茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to tell Mrs Hudson and Molly.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.36,1:19:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉所有相信你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, tell anyone who will listen to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.74,1:19:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为了自己创造了莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I created Moriarty for my own purposes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.67,1:19:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  闭嘴  夏洛克  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, shut up Sherlock. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.20,1:20:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们第一次见面的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time we met... the first time we met,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.14,1:20:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就对我姐姐的事了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}you knew all about my sister, right?  
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.89,1:20:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人有那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody could be that clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.97,1:20:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.00,1:20:15.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我调查了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I researched you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.43,1:20:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们见面之前  我查了所有关于你的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we met, I discovered everything that I could
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.44,1:20:20.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了打动你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to impress you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.36,1:20:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个把戏罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trick. Just a magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.70,1:20:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  快别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. All right, stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.82,1:20:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  站在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Stay exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.73,1:20:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别动  - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.68,1:20:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes fixed on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.40,1:20:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求你了  你能为我做这件事吗  - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, will you do this for me? - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.81,1:20:43.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This phone call, it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.91,1:20:46.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's my note.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.72,1:20:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们都会这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what people do, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.02,1:20:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a note?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.62,1:20:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留什么鬼遗言啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a note when?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.93,1:21:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见  约翰  - 不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, John. - No. Don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.95,1:21:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.76,1:21:18.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.50,1:22:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock... Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.93,1:22:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是医生  让我过去  快让我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor, let me come through. Let me come through, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.06,1:22:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我朋友  是我朋友  求求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my friend. He's my friend... Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.78,1:22:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你们了  让我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let me just...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.24,1:22:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.31,1:22:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.69,1:22:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.15,1:24:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's stuff that you wanted to say...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.61,1:24:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 却没有说的话  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but didn't say it. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.99,1:24:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在说出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.56,1:24:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.07,1:24:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有那些东西  那些科学仪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's all the stuff. All the science equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.48,1:25:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都装在盒子里了  不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left it all in boxes. I don't know what needs doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.68,1:25:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得还是捐给学校吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd take it to a school.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.36,1:25:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you...?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.21,1:25:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在暂时没法回去  我要缓一缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go back to the flat again, not at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.35,1:25:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.27,1:25:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  约翰  这没什么奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, John. There's nothing unusual in that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.79,1:25:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让每个人都生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way he made everyone feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.38,1:25:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他在我桌子上留下的记号  还有那些噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the marks on my table and the noise,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.08,1:25:28.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在凌晨一点半开枪  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- firing guns at half past one in the morning... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.42,1:25:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还把该死的标本放在我冰箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody specimens in my fridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.62,1:25:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能在放食物的地方放尸体  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Imagine, keeping bodies where there's food. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.59,1:25:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还打架  他做的那些蠢事真气死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the fighting! Drove me up the wall with all his carryings-on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.74,1:25:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我其实也没那么生气  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm not actually that angry, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.48,1:25:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我让你一个人待会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I'll leave you alone to, you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾经对我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... you told me once...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.32,1:26:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you weren't a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.02,1:26:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有时也觉得你不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were times I didn't even think you were human,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.43,1:26:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我要对你说  你是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but let me tell you this, you were...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.55,1:26:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best man...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.64,1:26:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最出色...最有人情味的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most human... human being that I've ever known
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.32,1:26:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人能让我相信  这一切都是你的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no-one will ever convince me that you told me a lie, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.60,1:26:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.44,1:26:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到你之前  我好孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so alone...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.42,1:26:39.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠你好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I owe you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.64,1:26:45.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  求你了  再求你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, please, there's just one more thing, 
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.81,1:26:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一件事  就一个奇迹  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}one more thing, one more miracle, Sherlock, 
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.15,1:26:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我  求你不要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me, don't be...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.71,1:26:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.76,1:26:56.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吗  就当是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you do that just for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.84,1:26:59.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  不要这么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop it. Stop this.
